{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54343","headline":"裴侍郎湘川回以青竹筒相遗因而赠之 · 钱珝","name":"裴侍郎湘川回以青竹筒相遗因而赠之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚竹青玉润，从来湘水阴。\n缄书取直节，君子知虚心。\n入用随宪简，积文不受金。\n体将丹凤直，色映秋霜深。\n宁肯假伶伦，谬爲龙凤吟。\n唯将翰院客，昔秘瑶华音。\n长跪捧嘉贶，岁寒惭所钦。\n（同前。\n吴企明云裴侍郎爲裴瓒）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱珝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}